    {
      "hook": "on-pre-commit.js (freno de autoría: roster vs registro local)",
      "script": "${SKILLS}/skills/tycon-pipeline/scripts/on-pre-commit.js",
      "event": "PreToolUse",
      "matcher": "Bash",
      "cases": [
        {
          "id": "camino-feliz-no-frena-y-NO-crashea",
          "__nota": "El caso que faltaba y por eso pasó un crash: con el roster presente y válido, el freno usaba mal el resultado del registro y tiraba un TypeError. El hook falla ABIERTO, así que el commit se saltaba TODOS sus controles (evidencia DoD incluida) justo en el camino más común. Lo cazó el pase adversarial de la pieza; este caso lo deja fijado.",
          "type": "must-not-block",
          "setup": [
            "git init -q -b main .",
            "mkdir -p specs/stories",
            "printf '%s\\n' '---' 'story: \"4.2\"' 'epic: \"4\"' 'status: in-progress' 'dod_runtime_exempt: true' 'dod_runtime_exempt_reason: \"puro docs\"' '---' '# Story 4.2' '' '## Acceptance Criteria' '1. AC uno' > specs/stories/4-2.md",
            "git add -A && git -c user.email=b@b -c user.name=b commit -q -m base",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const p='specs/stories/4-2.md';fs.writeFileSync(p,fs.readFileSync(p,'utf8').replace('status: in-progress','status: done'))\"",
            "git add specs/stories/4-2.md",
            "mkdir -p .advisors/pipeline-runs/4.2-20260901120000 && echo '[]' > .advisors/pipeline-runs/4.2-20260901120000/findings.json",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d=process.env.SANDBOX_HOME+'/.claude/.tycon-pipeline/advisor-runs';fs.mkdirSync(d,{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync(d+'/bench-rg.jsonl',JSON.stringify({ts:new Date().toISOString(),advisor:'tycon-plugin-security-basics',model:'opus',repo:process.env.FIXTURE,story:'4.2'})+'\\n')\"",
            "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');fs.writeFileSync('.advisors/pipeline-runs/4.2-20260901120000/review-roster.json',JSON.stringify(Object.assign({version:1,story:'4.2',implementer:{kind:'sesion-principal',session_id:'bench-rg'},reviewers:[{agent:'tycon-plugin-security-basics',kind:'subagente'}],iterations:1},{})))\""
          ],
          "stdin": {
            "session_id": "bench-rg",
            "tool_name": "Bash",
            "tool_input": {
              "command": "git commit -m \"story 4.2 done\""
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "exit": 0,
            "stderr_not_re": [
              "TypeError",
              "FAILING OPEN"
            ]
          }
        },
